      <li>Automated dispensing and interaction-checking software are already absorbing routine counter work, and India's e-pharmacy market is growing roughly 16% a year — not a replacement for the licensed profession, but real pressure on the generalist counter task.</li>
      <li><strong>Building a genuine high-value skill portfolio — specialisation plus certification plus documented clinical judgment — is what turns pharmacy into real high income opportunities and earlier financial freedom, not the licence alone.</strong></li>
